1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,308
Good afternoon, thank you for calling Northwind Insurance claims. My name is Ayesha. How can I help you today?

2
00:00:09,108 --> 00:00:14,492
Hi Ayesha, I need to report an accident. Someone hit my car yesterday evening.

3
00:00:15,192 --> 00:00:18,269
I'm sorry to hear that. Is everyone okay?

4
00:00:18,869 --> 00:00:25,023
Yes, thankfully nobody was hurt, but the rear bumper and the tail light are badly damaged.

5
00:00:25,923 --> 00:00:28,615
Can I have your policy number please?

6
00:00:29,215 --> 00:00:30,369
Sure, it's POL-48213377.

7
00:00:31,169 --> 00:00:34,631
Thank you. And the best email to reach you?

8
00:00:35,131 --> 00:00:39,362
It's [EMAIL], and my phone number is [PHONE].

9
00:00:40,362 --> 00:00:45,746
Let me put you on a short hold while I pull up the policy.

10
00:01:36,246 --> 00:01:40,092
Thank you for waiting. I have your policy open now.

11
00:01:40,292 --> 00:01:48,754
So it happened around six thirty on the main road near the market and traffic was moving slowly because of the rain

12
00:01:48,854 --> 00:01:58,854
and the car behind me did not stop in time and it went straight into the back of my car and pushed it forward a little

13
00:01:58,954 --> 00:02:07,031
the other driver got out and apologised and we exchanged numbers and took photos of both cars and the number plates

14
00:02:07,131 --> 00:02:15,977
then a police officer came over and wrote down what happened and gave me a reference slip which I still have with me

15
00:02:16,077 --> 00:02:25,308
the bumper is cracked the left tail light is broken and the boot does not close properly anymore so I cannot drive it far

16
00:02:25,408 --> 00:02:34,254
I took it to a garage this morning and they said the estimate would be around four thousand eight hundred and fifty dollars

17
00:02:34,354 --> 00:02:38,200
uh it was the uh other driver's fault I think

18
00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:41,592
Understood. I've opened claim CLM-2026-004417 for you.

19
00:02:45,385 --> 00:02:48,846
For the deductible, can I take a card number?

20
00:02:49,446 --> 00:02:51,754
Yes, it's [CARD].

21
00:02:57,592 --> 00:03:03,362
Great, that's all done. An adjuster will call you within two business days. Anything else?

22
00:03:04,062 --> 00:03:06,754
No, that's everything. Thanks for your help.

23
00:03:07,354 --> 00:03:09,662
You're welcome. Have a good day.
